    "relation tables are assigned to the unit owning the spec array that absorbs them",
    "model_only collections (sale, purchase, stock, account) are not units: listed per unit as cross-boundary references only",
    "wave width 4; one dependency depth per wave; no two batches share a write target",
    "all units depend on the ORM MongoDB storage path (parallel ticket) — not implemented here"
  ],
  "source_access": "live",
  "target_access": "migration_cluster",
  "target_database": "odoo_migration",
  "fixture_manifest": ".migration/fixtures/odoo_fixture.json",
