    "Wave 2 holds a single unit (product-catalog) because every depth-2 unit references productProduct/productTemplate; it is also the unit carrying all R rewrites and both full-shadow tables, so it gets the wave to itself by design.",
    "Fixture has 0 rows in 11 of the 33 tables (listed per unit under recon_risks.fixture_zero_rows); strict recon on those is schema-only until the unit run adds scenario rows."
  ],
